From b81950402ed84d066303029010453347ea56e6d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:31:25 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 38/38] po: the 3D options in the languages of Sparky Stereo OS

The 3D packing of the video and the eye swap, with every packing, in
Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Japanese, Korean and
Simplified and Traditional Chinese.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
